{"id":"vod_bf_23944","vodId":"23944","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"魔术士欧菲流浪之旅","name_cn":"魔术士欧菲流浪之旅","date":"2020-01-01","year":"2020","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-25/3a5e10004ea53f9eaab1ae2fab4ac2e4.jpg"},"summary":"奇利男谢洛（森久保祥太郎 配音）是大陆最强魔术士查尔德曼（中田让治 配音）的得意弟子，在获得了“钢之继承者”的名号之后，谢洛离开了牙之塔，化名欧菲踏上了寻找姐姐阿丽莎的旅途。虽然阿丽莎已经异形化，并且犯下了滔天的罪行，但欧菲依然相信自己能够找到让姐姐恢复原状的方法。　　在旅途中，欧菲邂逅了开朗又活泼的大小姐克丽奥（大久保瑠美 配音），和非常崇拜欧菲，拜他为师的青年马吉克（小林裕介 配音），三人结伴而行，与此同时，欧菲的师父查尔德曼也集结了曾经的一群战友，决定正式启动讨伐阿丽莎的计划。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 03:02:43","playable":true,"episodeCount":14,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/moshushioufeiliulangzhilv/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/moshushioufeiliulangzhilv/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/moshushioufeiliulangzhilv/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/moshushioufeiliulangzhilv/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/moshushioufeiliulangzhilv/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/moshushioufeiliulangzhilv/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/moshushioufeiliulangzhilv/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/moshushioufeiliulangzhilv/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/moshushioufeiliulangzhilv/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/moshushioufeiliulangzhilv/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/moshushioufeiliulangzhilv/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/moshushioufeiliulangzhilv/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/mosh